    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48814019502abe264a755887",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌一边跑步一边开心地大叫。\n不顾一切朝着前方奔驰的她，\n就像是在不断地加速着──",
      "source_fingerprint": "bae466b9932d1d8e988c5a05c8c25554c47f7bb07e298382942899ff4ffc23b0",
